C TERMS USED IN EXPANSION FOR HIGHER-ORDER TERMS FOR A
C COMBINED FUNCTION BENDING MAGNET
C
C SMLCX              SX - L*CX
C XPND               TRUE IF HIGHER-ORDER TERMS ARE TO BE
C                    EXPANDED IN A SERIES IN MAGNET LENGTH
C
      LOGICAL        XPND
      REAL           SMLCX
C
      COMMON /TERMS/ SMLCX, XPND
